@{ ViewBag.Title = "About"; ViewBag.BodyClass = "content-page"; }
<section class="page-hero content-hero"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT AUTODEALER.DEV</span><h1>Built where automotive data meets the customer experience.</h1><p>We help dealers and developers turn complex vehicle information into connected, useful experiences—from the first API request to the moment a customer finds the right car.</p></div></section>

<section class="section light-section content-section"><div class="shell editorial-grid about-editorial">
    <div><h2>Powerful automotive technology should feel simple.</h2></div>
    <div class="editorial-copy about-editorial-copy">
        <p>AutoDealer.dev exists to close the gap between dependable vehicle data and the digital tools dealerships rely on every day. Instead of stitching together disconnected services, teams can work from one focused platform built around real automotive workflows.</p>
        <p>Our approach is practical: make the data complete, make the integration predictable, and make every customer-facing experience clear enough to move people forward.</p>
        <div class="value-strip about-values"><span><b>COMPLETE DATA</b>Useful vehicle records without unnecessary complexity.</span><span><b>CONNECTED EXPERIENCES</b>APIs and dealer tools designed to work together.</span><span><b>BUILT FOR PROGRESS</b>A foundation that can grow with the business.</span></div>
    </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section light-section content-section about-capabilities-section"><div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading about-section-heading"><h2>One platform, built for both sides of the experience.</h2><p>Dealers need digital retail tools that feel natural to customers. Developers need stable foundations they can trust in production. We design for both.</p></div>
    <div class="about-grid">
        <article class="about-card"><span class="color-icon icon-teal" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#icon-browser"></use></svg></span><h2>For modern dealerships</h2><p>Inventory should look accurate, polished, and easy to explore. We bring vehicle search, merchandising, lead paths, and dealer operations together in a digital showroom shaped around the way people actually shop.</p></article>
        <article class="about-card"><span class="color-icon icon-blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#icon-code"></use></svg></span><h2>For product and development teams</h2><p>Automotive integrations should be understandable from the first request. Our APIs prioritize predictable formats, secure access, complete records, and documentation that helps teams move confidently toward production.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="about-contact"><p>Building a dealer website or planning an automotive data integration?</p><a class="button site-cta" href="@Url.Action("Contact", "Home")"><span>Start a conversation</span><i aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</i></a></div>
</div></section>
